        en: 'Through inheritance: class CricketFan(PartyAnimal) made every cricket fan a party animal — so party and its properties moved to the child without rewriting a single line, and even the constructor was borrowed from the parent to store Jim. And dir(j) found points, added by the child, next to the inherited things. Everything you learned about classes now travels through a whole family.',
