        en: "Two lines only separate CricketFan from its parent: points and six. Sally's object is a pure party animal: one party call raised the count to 1. Jim is a child: he inherited the constructor which printed Jim constructed, and the first inherited party call raised his count to 1. Then six arrived: it added six points, called self.party() — the parent's code running on the child's object — raising the count to 2, then printed Jim points 6. type(j) confirmed the object is of the child's class, and isinstance confirmed it is a party animal too. Inherited and added, in one object.",
